  "question": {
    "text": "For a second order reaction, <math><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>→</mo></math> Products, a plot of log <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math> vs log a (where, 'a' is initial concentration) will give an intercept equal to which one of the following?"
