  "solution": {
    "text": "Kinetic equation for second order reaction is<br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math><br />when <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math><br /><img src=\"assets\\st0089_c1c59d50aca9.jpeg\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" style=\"width:2.45833in;height:1.75833in\" /><br />So <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">log</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">log</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>-</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">log</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow></mrow></math><br />Here intercept = log k"
